WEBVTT

00:05:29.502 --> 00:05:33.014
Woman: Well, I thought you'd be home a couple hours ago, and I put everything away, so—

00:05:33.014 --> 00:05:36.058
Man: What is this? Pizza.
Woman: If you had just called me,
I would have known—

00:05:36.058 --> 00:05:39.231
Man: Dinner? Dinner ready is a pizza?
Woman: Honey, please don't be so loud.

00:05:39.231 --> 00:05:41.136
Please don't—Let go of me!

00:05:41.136 --> 00:05:44.030
Man: Get in the kitchen!
Woman: No! Help!

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.385
Man: You want to see what hurts? (Slaps woman)

00:05:46.385 --> 00:05:49.803
That's what hurts! That's what hurts!
(Breaking glass)

00:05:49.803 --> 00:05:52.044
Woman: Help me!

00:05:52.044 --> 00:05:55.463
["Children have to sit by and watch.
What's your excuse?"]

00:05:55.463 --> 00:05:57.482
Esta Soler: As we were in the process

00:05:57.482 --> 00:05:59.144
of releasing this campaign,

00:05:59.144 --> 00:06:01.327
O.J. Simpson was arrested